# Vite Environment Variables for Octofit Tracker Frontend
# 
# VITE_CODESPACE_NAME is required for the application to connect to the backend API
# in GitHub Codespaces. Replace 'your-codespace-name' with your actual Codespace name.
#
# Example for Codespaces:
# VITE_CODESPACE_NAME=super-duper-lamp-vpxw7qr9g6qhww6x
#
# For local development without Codespaces, the app will fall back to localhost:8000
# and you can leave this commented out.

# VITE_CODESPACE_NAME=your-codespace-name
